{"parentUuid":"f286d299-17a1-413b-a7c2-bcc442795e7d","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"de187d87-78e0-4fae-b609-5bd6538472df","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012Mt3E9FM2FAyXx8U2WoaXe","type":"tool_result","content":"| Spiral vase with more than one material, a smooth timelapse or clumping detection with the \\\"by object\\\" sequence | Two modes that cannot run together; one has to go, and which is the person's choice when it changes what they asked for. |\r\n| Speed, acceleration or jerk above the printer's maximum; precise Z height or clumping detection beside the prime tower | Warnings, not refusals: I slice anyway, capping the motion values. |\"\n\n\u001b[36m \u001b[2m❯\u001b[22m src/skills.test.ts:\u001b[2m131:18\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\n    \u001b[90m129| \u001b[39m\n    \u001b[90m130| \u001b[39m  \u001b[34mit\u001b[39m(\u001b[32m'stands on the standing rules and stays well under the file-loade\u001b[39m…\n    \u001b[90m131| \u001b[39m    \u001b[34mexpect\u001b[39m(text)\u001b[33m.\u001b[39m\u001b[34mtoMatch\u001b[39m(\u001b[36m/^# [^\\n]+\\n\\nThe rules above still apply\\./\u001b[39m)\u001b[33m;\u001b[39m\n    \u001b[90m   | \u001b[39m                 \u001b[31m^\u001b[39m\n    \u001b[90m132| \u001b[39m    \u001b[34mexpect\u001b[39m(encoder\u001b[33m.\u001b[39m\u001b[34mencode\u001b[39m(text)\u001b[33m.\u001b[39mlength)\u001b[33m.\u001b[39m\u001b[34mtoBeLessThan\u001b[39m(encoder\u001b[33m.\u001b[39m\u001b[34mencode\u001b[39m(fi…\n    \u001b[90m133| \u001b[39m  })\u001b[33m;\u001b[39m\n\n\u001b[31m\u001b[2m⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯[1/2]⎯\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\n\n\u001b[31m\u001b[1m\u001b[7m FAIL \u001b[27m\u001b[22m\u001b[39m src/skills.test.ts\u001b[2m > \u001b[22mthe skill for a setup to check against the print's purpose\u001b[2m > \u001b[22mopens under the standing rules and stays short\n\u001b[31m\u001b[1mTypeError\u001b[22m: .toMatch() expects to receive a string, but got undefined\u001b[39m\n\u001b[36m \u001b[2m❯\u001b[22m